      "description": "Back, progress, and forward action. Explicit Home exits; Escape keeps the room.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Selection steps\"><button class=\"ds-secondary\">BACK</button><span>2 / 3 ? PLAYERS</span><button class=\"ds-primary\">SEE MATCHUP</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-primary,.ds-secondary,.ds-quiet{cursor:pointer;border-radius:0;transition:background .15s,transform .15s}.ds-primary:active,.ds-secondary:active,.ds-quiet:active{transform:translateY(2px)}.ds-primary:disabled,.ds-secondary:disabled,.ds-quiet:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default;transform:none}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-quiet:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--mint,#c9ef93);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary,.ds-secondary,.ds-quiet,.ds-card{transition:none}}.ds-primary{background:var(--gold,#ffc460);color:#301b23;border:2px solid #ffe3a5;padding:12px 18px;font:750 13px/1.8 var(--arcade,monospace)}.ds-primary:hover{background:#ffdc8d}.ds-secondary{background:#33253d;color:var(--ink,#fff3d7);border:2px solid #866785;padding:12px 18px;font:750 16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-secondary:hover{background:#4b3654}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:19px 28px;border-top:2px solid #ac8053;background:#1c1427;gap:16px}.ds-nav>span{font:11px/1.8 var(--arcade,monospace);color:var(--muted,#cbbbcc)}.ds-nav>button{font-size:11px}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{padding:14px 12px;gap:9px}.ds-nav>span{display:none}.ds-nav>button{padding:10px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Selected side tag",
      "kind": "chip",
      "description": "Noninteractive tag identifying which side uses a franchise.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-side-tag\">SIDE 1</span>",
      "css": ".ds-side-tag{font:800 11px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--gold,#ffc460);color:#301b23;padding:3px 5px;white-space:nowrap}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Franchise choice",
      "kind": "card",
      "description": "Original emblem, mascot, city, and explicit selection state.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-card\" aria-label=\"Sacramento Kingdras\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-side-tag\">SIDE 1</span><svg class=\"ds-emblem\" viewBox=\"0 0 80 80\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#1c1427\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M13 26 28 38 40 17 52 38 67 26 59 57 21 57Z M23 64 57 64\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\"/></svg><strong>KINGDRAS</strong><small>Sacramento</small></button>",
      "css": ".ds-card{cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;position:relative;padding:14px 3px 12px;background:#251b30;border:2px solid #a57b55;border-radius:0;color:var(--ink,#fff3d7);transition:background .15s,transform .15s}.ds-card:hover{background:var(--team-dark,#503674)}.ds-card:active{transform:translateY(2px)}.ds-card[aria-pressed=true]{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#ffc460);outline-offset:2px;background:var(--team-dark,#503674)}.ds-card:disabled{opacity:.65;cursor:default;transform:none}.ds-emblem{width:66px;height:66px;margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--team-color,#c4a0f2)}.ds-card strong{font:800 13px/1.8 system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--team-color,#c4a0f2);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-card small{font:11px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif;min-height:32px;margin-top:5px}.ds-card .ds-side-tag{position:absolute;top:-11px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%)}.ds-side-tag{font:800 11px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--gold,#ffc460);color:#301b23;padding:3px 5px;white-space:nowrap}.ds-primary:focus-visible,.ds-secondary:focus-visible,.ds-quiet:focus-visible,.ds-input:focus-visible,.ds-card:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--mint,#c9ef93);outline-offset:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-primary,.ds-secondary,.ds-quiet,.ds-card{transition:none}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ratings and signature",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "ratings",
      "description": "Actual catalog ratings with ten segments, numbers, and signature effect.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-ratings\" aria-label=\"Player ratings\"><h2>Slowking</h2><p class=\"ds-role\">COURT GENERAL</p><div class=\"ds-row\" aria-label=\"Speed: 2 out of 10\"><span>Speed</span><span class=\"ds-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>2/10</strong></div><div class=\"ds-row\" aria-label=\"Shooting: 8 out of 10\"><span>Shooting</span><span class=\"ds-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>8/10</strong></div><div class=\"ds-row\" aria-label=\"Dunk: 4 out of 10\"><span>Dunk</span><span class=\"ds-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>4/10</strong></div><div class=\"ds-row\" aria-label=\"Steal: 6 out of 10\"><span>Steal</span><span class=\"ds-bars\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i class=\"ds-filled\"></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><strong>6/10</strong></div><div class=\"ds-signature\"><small>SIGNATURE ? FULL METER + L</small><strong>King's Assist</strong><p>Fire one faster pass to your teammate. Requires the ball.</p></div></aside>",
      "css": ".ds-ratings{min-width:0;background:#1c1427;border:2px solid #8b6650;padding:22px;color:var(--ink,#fff3d7);font:12px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-ratings h2{font:16px/1.8 var(--arcade,monospace);color:var(--team-color,#c4a0f2);margin:0 0 5px}.ds-role{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted,#cbbbcc);margin:0 0 20px}.ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:70px 1fr 36px;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:12px 0}.ds-row strong{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-bars{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(10,1fr);gap:3px}.ds-bars i{display:block;height:14px;background:#49384e}.ds-bars .ds-filled{background:var(--gold,#ffc460)}.ds-signature{padding-top:14px;margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid #765871}.ds-signature small{display:block;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted,#cbbbcc);margin-bottom:8px}.ds-signature strong{font:11px/1.8 var(--arcade,monospace);color:var(--mint,#c9ef93)}.ds-signature p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;margin:10px 0 0}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Indigo Arena arcade cabinet",
    "overview": "PokéJam uses the user-approved NBA Jam-inspired world: oversized Pokémon, pixel lettering, a warm hardwood court, stadium darkness, and direct game controls. The opening is a sequence of game screens that advances toward basketball. It supersedes the original long page with the court and room controls beneath an introduction.\n\nThis system records the built HTML, stylesheet, menu, renderer, and shared roster catalog. The direction is pinned and code-led; no generated comp or design seed applies. Screen composition lives in `.impeccable/surfaces/public-index-html.md`. Current menu captures are in `.impeccable/review/`; executed checks and remaining limits belong in `docs/verification/arcade-selection/verification.md`.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Aubergine enclosure, cream text, gold actions, mint focus, and franchise-colored identity.",
      "Square panels and original geometric franchise emblems around credited pixel sprites.",
      "Display type for spectacle; system sans for compact names, descriptions, and state labels.",
      "Animated portraits and basketball action, with an explicit reduced-motion path."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Side Identity Rule",
        "body": "Franchise color follows the selected franchise, never a fixed left/right side. Gold marks selection and mint marks focus; neither replaces the franchise name or player status.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Readable Cabinet Rule",
        "body": "Pixel lettering supplies identity at display scale. Compact functional content may use sans; preserving a decorative font never justifies clipped names or sub-11px HTML controls. Canvas lettering uses the fixed game coordinate system and is not an HTML text-size token.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Pixel Edge Rule",
        "body": "Render Canvas and sprite imagery without smoothing. Preserve sprite frame bounds, pivots, per-species scales, and front-facing ball anchors; source row 2 faces right and row 6 faces left. Keep sprite provenance in `public/assets/CREDITS.md` when changing assets.",
        "section": "shapes"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep one clear forward action per game screen and usable Back/Home navigation.",
      "**Do** pair franchise color with names, side numbers, and explicit ownership state.",
      "**Do** keep functional HTML text at least 11px and use compact sans labels where pixel names become cramped.",
      "**Do** preserve pixel edges, sprite metadata, source credits, and basketball readability.",
      "**Do** preserve visible keyboard focus, reduced motion, muted startup, and readable numeric ratings."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** shrink the team board below three columns or the roster below three columns at the established 390px layout; let the page scroll vertically.",
      "**Don't** replace the angled court or authored basketball motion with a menu-only spectacle.",
      "**Don't** add an eyebrow above the home wordmark; it competes with the title and was removed in review.",
      "**Don't** present locked choices as editable or display invented ratings unrelated to the simulation.",
      "**Don't** infer touch gameplay, competitive balance, audible verification, other-engine verification, or public hosting from these visuals."
    ]
  }
}
